<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/cve> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures identifiers, an identifier for a specific software flaw defined within the official CVE Dictionary and that conforms to the [CVE specification](https://csrc.nist.gov/glossary/term/cve_id)."@en .
